WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:03.101
WATCH. A kitten eats and grows beside a toy car.

00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:07.336
CHECK. The car moves when pushed but does not feed or grow.

00:00:08.200 --> 00:00:11.357
COMPARE. A fresh growing plant and a dry fallen leaf.

00:00:12.200 --> 00:00:15.208
SORT. Living, once-living and never-living objects.
